":["근ː처"]},{"id":"9630c6227715da13","term":"은행","zh":"银行","audio":"/audio/9630c6227715da131d3e.mp3","entryId":"71109","definition":"负责管理人们的钱并把钱借给需要的人的机构。","pronunciation":["은행"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]}],"audio":"/audio/f9dd252a4c4144720815.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25545-4-3-2","ko":"네, 모퉁이를 돌면 곧바로 보일 겁니다.","zh":"是的，转过街角就能马上看到。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"모퉁이를","meaning":"转角，拐角","explanation":"모퉁이：转角，拐角；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"모퉁이","audio":"/audio/9436efc2c3513615fd9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16148","senseId":"1","lemma":"모퉁이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모퉁이를","audio":"/audio/8c4cd1699ca2cb073207.mp3"}},{"text":"돌면","meaning":"转，拐","explanation":"돌다：转，拐；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"돌다","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75006","senseId":"19","lemma":"돌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌면","audio":"/audio/e3e59e28da73de92c5b2.mp3"}},{"text":"곧바로","meaning":"就","explanation":"곧바로：就。","readings":[{"term":"곧바로","audio":"/audio/7cfe117c3a6d5cc2ca08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25545","senseId":"4","lemma":"곧바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곧바로","audio":"/audio/7cfe117c3a6d5cc2ca08.mp3"}},{"text":"보일","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决